      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SILENT BANDIT (8) held his own to the line last start and filled a minor placing, beaten only half a length (22.62) behind Spring Layla at Bulli. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Racing well and deserves a win. NANGAR NOAH (3) is progressing well scoring last time out (24.70) at this track and bringing up his 2nd career win. Comes out of a hot form race last start. Can make it back-to-back wins. MORALE SPONGE (1) produced a moderate effort last time when eighth at Nowra over 365m behind Night Country (21.90) in a Grade 4. Form from her last run is proving to be solid. Likely to be thereabouts. ADDY'S GIRL (4) showed plenty of dash to record a last start win. Must be respected.",
